_2710374385793731_4335129908217143921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hXGzotIXRqoQ7kNvwF2Q2CZ&_nc_oc=Adq8tftt7fl3XrpUqz_1Jtn_NK_ryLRdAr0tDszN572ivlcKNoOD9iGm1xCohtxfK4Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIu3HGRQZ9dPgjQahK5EoMvGh9-X-xVcvwcWp336Of_SQ&oe=6A98629E"}, {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "1819549741885168", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984474_1819549745218501_878499352484891744_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gazQ-seBSrkQ7kNvwEuMb8S&_nc_oc=AdrLTrkRaS_T7yKTqZ6MiHx5cYiT-rw3LMFnNLPOR7UR0P4xU02ZcOlyJoeWJ-1vdbQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQINfku6iydc_MDb8cBpBIeyaP542UHywg5l2eAG_ksyHg&oe=6A98386D"}, {"file_name": "002.png", "id": "790364216531353", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974483_790364219864686_8155488325575676486_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hQf8Jxo4FPMQ7kNvwHDhw8l&_nc_oc=AdoojpFQqVcJ4jySWXBNWO7nkdj8-xk1TC_BR5EHdgvdscPA-hF9G_Y6PAPXvHSMEZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIu76zaxr7zKaQtgSi0eLIqhm-aoivFMblwwJfz61immg&oe=6A9850AC"}, {"file_name": "001.png", "id": "1205543714149528", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75269591_1205543717482861_1636873667456873713_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1nZmb7IT768Q7kNvwFgSo_T&_nc_oc=AdpAxGL7cNsy6BvMi-S_htFCx2qTwlcbBJ9P_iVe8qHIzx3KorjKxJm4xqeYI4zs5js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkeYuBV_LFGi_YdTOaTmN-FMVZLZkoqBPpc1Kw2_wygQ&oe=6A985874"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "476707408073775", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75294244_476707411407108_5418331704720470775_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yTdz7wQVAOsQ7kNvwE02GSB&_nc_oc=Adr9bBF8JEb_D_P-VplsTsXv50wuQUlI0li54K8btCfiUPLH9E8FyRl9t8PACST9xts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJJX13vtC7aO6j_4R9jT5osNeCtn4DAAXW0kNUfqnOSQQ&oe=6A984878"}, "display_name": "Virnect View", "keywords": ["virnect", "view", "ar", "industry", "virnectview"], "long_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency with VIRNECT View.\n\nEasily augment manuals on actual equipment to confirm equipment usage.\n\nCheck real-time field data and operate processes efficiently.\n\nShorten training time for new employees by utilizing realistic educational content.\n\n[Main Features]\n\nSpatial-based AR Content Visualization\nAllows for more accurate problem confirmation than paper manuals\n\nOffline Environment Support\nDownload AR content to your device for easy access even in offline environments.\n\nReal-time Data Monitoring\nConnects data information to content for direct on-site viewing.\n\nWork Result Report Writing\nCreate reports while viewing AR content.\n(Supports text input, photo capture, and checklist-style work reporting)\n\nImmersive Content\nProvides a more immersive content experience through various animations and interaction functions.\n\n[Access Permission Guide]\n\nIf necessary access is not allowed, there may be restrictions on service usage.\n\n[Open Source License Guide]\n\nIn-App Information Notification\n\n[Customer Support Center]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/support/inquiry\n\n[Website]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/\n\nThis is an enterprise app. Please purchase licenses from the payment center (web) to use.", "short_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency by using VIRNECT View.\n\nYou can easily check how to use the equipment by augmenting the manual on the actual equipment.\n\nSee real-time field data and operate the process efficiently.\n\nTraining time for new employees can be shortened by using realistic educational content."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://console.virnect.com/legal?type=policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://console.virnect.com/l